menu "SDGOODS Board (BSP)"

    config SDGOODS_SCREENSHOT
        bool "Enable screenshot capability (serial 's')"
        default y
        help
          Capture the screen over USB-Serial-JTAG and stream it to a PC
          (JPEG, decoded on the device). Exposes the SDGOODS_CAP_SCREENSHOT
          capability, which the web upload page queries (serial '?') before
          capturing. Disable to shrink the firmware if screenshot is not needed;
          the web page will then prompt the developer to re-enable it.

endmenu
